"comparison": "Both GS and C define how net unrealized gains/losses are treated in the Level 3 rollforward for assets still held at period-end. GS states that 'Net unrealized gains/(losses) relates to investments that were still held at period-end' (gs_2024_8_P175_S003). Similarly, C defines this component as '(3)Represents the amount of total gains or losses for the period... attributable to the change in fair value relating to assets and liabilities classified as Level 3 that are still held at December 31, 2024' (c_2024_8_P810_S001). Both disclosures confirm that this specific metric captures only the gains/losses on positions remaining in Level 3 at the end of the period, excluding those sold or transferred out.",
